{{!-- A 4:3 archive card: image over an eyebrow, headline, excerpt and one meta line.

	{{> "archive/card"}}                                   the tag archive's
	{{> "archive/card" tagEyebrow=true eyebrowSpacing="mt-4" titleClass="text-[22px]" excerptSpacing="mt-2.5"}}
	                                                       the author archive's

	tagEyebrow       lead with the post's primary tag in the accent, and sign off with the date
	eyebrowSpacing   space above the eyebrow row — 18px on the tag archive, 16px on the author's
	titleClass       headline size — 24px on the tag archive, 22px on the author's
	excerptSpacing   space above the excerpt — 12px on the tag archive, 10px on the author's

The card half of archive/row.hbs, and the same trade: on a tag archive the date leads and the
writer signs off, on an author archive the tag leads and the date signs off. See that file for
why the two Surfaces share one drawing.

A post with no feature image starts at the eyebrow, which is what the Feed's grid and the
related-reading strip already do — a placeholder panel in a post grid would be the theme
inventing a photograph. --}}
<article class="{{post_class}}">
	<a
		href="{{url}}"
		class="text-text block no-underline">
		{{#if feature_image}}
			<img
				src="{{img_url feature_image size="m"}}"
				{{#if feature_image_alt}}alt="{{feature_image_alt}}"{{else}}alt=""{{/if}}
				loading="lazy"
				decoding="async"
				class="border-border block aspect-[4/3] w-full rounded-md border object-cover">
		{{/if}}

		<div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 {{#if eyebrowSpacing}}{{eyebrowSpacing}}{{else}}mt-[18px]{{/if}}">
			{{#if tagEyebrow}}
				{{#primary_tag}}
					<span class="font-meta text-meta tracking-meta text-accent uppercase">{{name}}</span>
				{{/primary_tag}}
			{{else}}
				<span class="font-meta text-meta tracking-meta text-muted uppercase">{{date format="DD MMM YYYY"}}</span>
			{{/if}}

			{{> "tier-chip"}}
		</div>

		<h2
			class="font-display tracking-heading mt-2.5 leading-[1.22] font-medium text-balance {{#if titleClass}}{{titleClass}}{{else}}text-2xl{{/if}}">{{title}}</h2>

		{{#if excerpt}}
			<p
				class="text-small text-muted leading-[1.58] {{#if excerptSpacing}}{{excerptSpacing}}{{else}}mt-3{{/if}}">{{excerpt}}</p>
		{{/if}}

		<p class="font-meta text-meta tracking-meta text-muted mt-3.5 uppercase">
			{{#if tagEyebrow}}
				{{~date format="DD MMM YYYY"~}}
			{{else}}
				{{~#primary_author}}{{name}}{{/primary_author~}}
			{{/if}}
			<span aria-hidden="true"> · </span>
			{{~reading_time seconds=(t "< 1 min read") minute=(t "1 min read") minutes=(t "% min read")~}}
		</p>
	</a>
</article>
